  "key_sentences": [
    "The Trust holds fourteen homes and two workshops, all let at rents below the local market level.",
    "Cash at bank rose by a quarter during the year because a planned roof replacement was postponed to the spring.",
    "All income and expenditure arise from continuing activities.",
    "The financial statements have been prepared on the historical cost basis, except that land is shown at valuation.",
    "Income is recognised when the Trust is entitled to it and the amount can be measured reliably.",
    "The Affordable Homes Fund may be used only to acquire or improve homes let at no more than eighty percent of local market rents.",
    "Two trustees are tenants of the Trust and pay rent on the same terms as other tenants.",
    "No trustee received any remuneration during the year."
  ],
